note 21_array_operations.vss — List Operations
make numbers becomes [10, 20, 30]
put 40 into numbers
put 50 into numbers

say "List elements: " + numbers
say "List size: " + size of numbers
say "First element: " + numbers[0]
make last_idx becomes size of numbers - 1
say "Last element: " + numbers[last_idx]
